:::text id=WtG2BqfbOq at=top-center width=86% height=80 offsetY=24 preset=title align=left
# Known Bugs & Support Patches
:::

:::text id=-_fQGtW_LY at=top-left width=80% height=32 offsetX=80 offsetY=120 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
BUG 1 · ASKING TOO MANY QUESTIONS
:::

:::text id=6oHlgNrGuz at=top-left width=80% height=48 offsetX=80 offsetY=152 preset=body align=left
**Support Patch:** Provide clear context and explain relevance to business, product, or team.
:::

:::text id=s_1W74oPFQ at=top-left width=80% height=32 offsetX=80 offsetY=240 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
BUG 2 · SLOW RESPONSE ON LOW ENERGY
:::

:::text id=Uot7lQpCsO at=top-left width=80% height=48 offsetX=80 offsetY=272 preset=body align=left
**Support Patch:** Allow time to recover; feel free to state explicitly if urgent.
:::

:::text id=KRzTQoFzLj at=top-left width=80% height=32 offsetX=80 offsetY=360 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
BUG 3 · INCOHERENT WHEN OVER-EXCITED
:::

:::text id=l8dpSHLo1O at=top-left width=80% height=48 offsetX=80 offsetY=392 preset=body align=left
**Support Patch:** Give time to let things sink in, and echo back what you hear.
:::

:::text id=bug4_caption at=top-left width=80% height=32 offsetX=80 offsetY=480 preset=caption align=left color=#F97316
BUG 4 · PUSHING SELF & TEAM TOO HARD
:::

:::text id=bug4_body at=top-left width=80% height=48 offsetX=80 offsetY=512 preset=body align=left
**Support Patch:** Speak up if it's not working or if energy is better spent elsewhere.
:::
